  "content": "<html>\n<body>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;你是否听说过这个模组——TerraFirmaCraft？因为某些模组不兼容以及缺乏冒险体验，你曾多次跳过它，甚至无法完整体验？现在，你的时刻到了！在失落已久的古代世界中，开启一段激动人心的新冒险，去揭开那些被隐藏了太久的秘密。我们精选了三款超人气且重新定义生存体验的模组，打造出一个细节最为丰富、制作最为精良的Minecraft整合包。尽情享受吧！</p>\n<h4>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 探索TerraFirmaCraft不再空旷的世界中超过100种全新结构。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:right\">通过自定义制作的驱动式书籍，学习新的模组和插件。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align-left\">实现TFC与Create和MineAndSlash的无缝集成。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">在新的程序生成维度中探索无尽的地下城。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align-left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 骑乘、驯服并战斗恐龙*。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;锻造你的装备，并在平衡的PvE和PvP系统中测试它们。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 经历游戏中最大的技能系统之一，学习新技能。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align-left\">使用数百种新武器和战斗法术，对抗全新的敌人。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align-left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;以令人惊喜的方式种植农作物并烹饪美味佳肴。&nbsp; &nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zZ9OcAh3I6s\" height=\"314\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VqJotchtzeA\" height=\"314\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xi3fhFI.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmacraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mine-and-slash-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineAndSlash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/firmalife\" rel=\"nofollow\">FirmaLife</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasm/\" rel=\"nofollow\">End's Phantasm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-dawn-era\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheDawnEra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astikor-carts-tfc\" rel=\"nofollow\">AstikorCarts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multistorage\" rel=\"nofollow\">MultiStorage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weather-storms-tornadoes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weather2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights</a></li>\n<li>DLC: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astral-dimension\" rel=\"nofollow\">AstralDimension</a></li>\n<li>DLC: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">IceAndFire</a></li>\n<li>DLC: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheAether</a></li>\n<li>超过50个生活质量（QOL）模组</li>\n<li>超过10个优化模组，确保完美性能</li>\n<li>3款精美着色器，已针对新模组进行调整</li>\n<li>还有更多！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zmM83bpSfp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://wiki.bfee.co/images/d/dd/Discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"272\"></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252foxfortpack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/969224/description_bacb310f-ba2a-4579-85a5-c9c30f53e50c.png\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"display:none;text-align:left\">\n<div style=\"display:none\">\n<div>TRANSLATE with <img> x</div>\n<div>\n<div>&lt;input id=\"Langua